    - rid: 4304780615459536898
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: greeting
        speakerName: Griff
        text: Well met. If you're here about the goblins, Mayor's got a bounty. If you're here for gear, I'm low on ore. Those pests inside the caves are blocking the main vein. Clear 'em, and I'll make it worth your while.
        nextNodeId: greeting-choice
    - rid: 4304780615459536899
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: greeting-choice
        options:
        - text: Consider the cave cleared, Griff.
          nextNodeId: accept-action
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
        - text: Not interested in mining trouble.
          nextNodeId: decline-line
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
        - text: Show me your wares.
          nextNodeId: open-store-action
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
    - rid: 4304780615459536900
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: accept-action
        action:
          rid: 4304780615459536910
        nextNodeId: accept-line
    - rid: 4304780615459536901
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: accept-line
        speakerName: Griff
        text: Good. Watch yourself down there.
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536902
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: decline-line
        speakerName: Griff
        text: Suit yourself. Good steel isn't cheap when supply is choked.
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536903
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: already-accepted-line
        speakerName: Griff
        text: Those goblins still holed up in my vein. Clear 'em and my prices will thank you.
        nextNodeId: already-accepted-choice
    - rid: 4304780615459536904
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: already-accepted-choice
        options:
        - text: Show me your wares.
          nextNodeId: open-store-action
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
